<title>HUNGARY: Hungary's BUX ends officially at 7,241.09 points.</title>
<headline>Hungary's BUX ends officially at 7,241.09 points.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's BUX index finished officially at 7,241.09 points, up 43.27 points or 0.60 percent, unchanged from the preliminary figures.</p>
<p>Spot share turnover totalled 5.952 billion forints, compared to 7.397 billion on Monday.</p>
<p>--Budapest newsroom +36 18327-4048</p>
